# Model Skill: Predicting Unexpected Failures
## Purpose
Predict probability of unexpected device failure using equipment attributes.
## When to Use
Building predictive maintenance alert models.
## Required Inputs
equipment_data.csv with unexpected_failure, device_age_years, operating_hours, and last_service_months_ago.
## Files Used
data/equipment_data.csv, final_report.qmd
## Method
Logistic Regression GLM (`glm(family = binomial)`).
## Procedure
Run model code chunk in final_report.qmd and calculate confusion matrix.
## Validation
Check model AIC, coefficient significance (p-values), and overall accuracy.
## Output
Regression coefficients summary, confusion matrix, and overall accuracy %.
## Interpretation
Quantifies risk factors for device breakdown.
## Limitation
Models statistical correlations rather than physical mechanical causality.